* TRACE ROUTINE
ENTER   STX   TEST(0:2)     Set the exit location.
        STX   LEAVEX(0:2)
        STA   AREG          Save the contents of rA.
        STJ   JREG          Save the contents of rJ.
        LDA   JREG(0:2)     Get the start location for tracing.
CYCLE   STA   PREG(0:2)     Store the location of the next instruction.
TEST    DECA  *             Is it the exit location?
        JAZ   LEAVE
PREG    LDA   *             Get the next instruction.
        STA   INST          Copy it.
        SRA   2
        STA   INST1(0:3)    Store the address and index parts.
        LDA   INST(5:5)     Get the operation code, C.
        DECA  38
        JANN  1F            Is C ≥ 38 (JRED)?
        INCA  6
        JANZ  2F            Is C ≠ 32 (STJ)?
        LDA   INST(0:4)
        STA   *+2(0:4)      Change STJ to STA.
JREG    ENTA  *             rA ← simulated rJ contents.
        STA   *
        JMP   INCP
2H      DECA  2
        JANZ  2F            Is C ≠ 34 (JBUS)?
        JMP   3F
1H      DECA  9             Test for jump instructions.
        JAP   2F            Is C > 47 (JXNP)?
3H      LDA   8F(0:3)       We detected a jump instruction;
        STA   INST(0:3)       change its address to ‘JUMP’.
2H      LDA   AREG          Restore register A.
*                           All registers except J now have proper
*                             values with respect to the external program.
INST    NOP   *             The instruction is executed.
        STA   AREG          Store register A again.
INCP    LDA   PREG(0:2)     Move to the next instruction.
        INCA  1
        JMP   CYCLE
8H      JSJ   JUMP          Constant for lines 29 and 40
JUMP    LDA   8B(4:5)       A jump has occurred.
        SUB   INST(4:5)     Was it JSJ?
        JAZ   *+4
        LDA   PREG(0:2)     If not, update the simulated
        INCA  1               J-register.
        STA   JREG(0:2)
INST1   ENTA  *
        JMP   CYCLE         Move to the address of the jump.
LEAVE   LDA   AREG          Restore register A.
LEAVEX  JMP   *             Stop tracing.
AREG    CON   0             Simulated rA contents
*
X        EQU   1000
         ORIG  3000
MAXIMUM  STJ   EXIT          Subroutine linkage
INIT     ENT3  0,1           M1. Initialize. k←n.
         JMP   CHANGEM       j←n, m←X[n], k←n−1.
LOOP     CMPA  X,3           M3. Compare.
         JGE   *+3           To M5 if m≥X[k].
CHANGEM  ENT2  0,3           M4. Change m. j ←k.
         LDA   X,3           m←X[k].
         DEC3  1             M5. Decrease k.
         J3P   LOOP          M2. All tested? To M3 if k>0.
EXIT     JMP   *
*
START    ENTX  DONE
         JMP   ENTER
         ENT1  5
         JMP   MAXIMUM
DONE     HLT
         END   START
